2.f. Define Each Term:
```

        a. Clone:      1. Copying repository from github to IDE

        b. Commit:     1. Saving changes in IDE to github

        c. Push:       1. Sending changes in IDE to github

        d. Branch:     1. Different copies of project to edit

        e. Pull:       1. Taking changes in remote main and bringing them to your local branch (branch of choice? just main?)

        f. Pull Request: 1. Requesting for your work in your branch to be pulled into the remote main branch.

        g. Merge:       1. Combining the work of one branch with another.

        h. Remote:      Projects on a remote repository in github; not stored on local machine, stored on web cloud etc.

        i. Local:       Something stored on local machine.

        j. Fetch:       Getting code from github

    Check your definitions against the [git glossary](https://help.github.com/articles/github-glossary/) 
    to ensure they are correct.
```

